{"ID":"20240506100112-mzqcsl3","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506100112-mzqcsl3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506100112-mzqcsl3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627114558-jja42kj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612143520-41448c7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3400,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240627114927-8jzf0rf\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"246蟅虫（蛰虫、土元、土鳖）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821172002"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240710172144-3bdgpg6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710172144-3bdgpg6","updated":"20240710172144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】\t鳖蠊科昆虫地鳖Eupolyphaga sinensis Walker 或冀地鳖Steleophaga plancyi (Boleny) 的雌虫干燥体。捕捉后，置沸水中烫死，晒干或烘干。\n【产地】\t主产于安徽、江苏、河南、四川等地。\n【性状】\t地鳖：呈扁平卵形，长1.33cm，宽1.22.4cm。前端较窄，后端较宽，背部紫褐色，具光泽，无翅。前胸背板较发达，盖住头部；腹背板9节，呈覆瓦状排列。腹面红棕色，头部较小，有丝状触角1对，常脱落，胸部有足3对，具细毛和刺。腹部有横环节。质松脆，易碎。气腥臭，味微咸。\n冀地鳖：长2.23.7cm，宽1.42.5cm。背部黑棕色，通常在边缘带有淡黄褐色斑块及黑色小点。\n【性味】\t咸，寒。\n【功效】\t破瘀血，续筋骨。用于筋骨折伤，瘀血经闭，症瘕痞块。"}]},{"ID":"20240710172144-4so6nas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710172144-4so6nas","updated":"20240710172144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206111634-z8t1hcy.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710172024-tvdv47v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710172024-tvdv47v","updated":"20240710172024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 598px;","style":"width: 588px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"土鳖"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/土鳖-20240205163530-oy0a3rk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 588px;\" parent-style=\"width: 598px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627114558-jja42kj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114558-jja42kj","updated":"20240627114558"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 600px;","style":"width: 590px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫-20240627114558-5q8bjv7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 590px;\" parent-style=\"width: 600px;\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240627115048-8zsi9io","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627115048-8zsi9io","updated":"20240821171851"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 385px;","style":"width: 375px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫4-20240627115048-tibf2tr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 375px;\" parent-style=\"width: 385px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 662px;","style":"width: 652px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地鳖"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地鳖-20240821171851-y0ji5s4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 652px;\" parent-style=\"width: 662px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240821172002-6semmku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240821172002-6semmku","updated":"20240821172002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 515px;","style":"width: 505px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫9"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫9-20240627115456-jghnohx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 505px;\" parent-style=\"width: 515px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 708px;","style":"width: 698px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫7"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫7-20240627115302-56yc0qc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 698px;\" parent-style=\"width: 708px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627114815-pesyuc5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114815-pesyuc5","updated":"20240821171726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 552px;","style":"width: 542px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫2-20240627114815-q6ipagk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 542px;\" parent-style=\"width: 552px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 623px;","style":"width: 613px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫6-20240627115218-pea5591.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 613px;\" parent-style=\"width: 623px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240627114927-8jzf0rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240627114927-8jzf0rf","updated":"20240821171947"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 638px;","style":"width: 628px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"地鳖 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/地鳖 1-20240821171932-rvgdyur.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 628px;\" parent-style=\"width: 638px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 596px;","style":"width: 586px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"蛰虫3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/蛰虫3-20240627114927-vo9l3s7.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 586px;\" parent-style=\"width: 596px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240612143345-cxw3695","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143345-cxw3695"}},{"ID":"20240612143435-p6j8f02","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-p6j8f02","updated":"20240612143441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟅虫《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143435-owo3tll","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-owo3tll","updated":"20240612143435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143435-39vzmf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-39vzmf7","updated":"20240612143435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主心腹寒热，洗洗，血积症瘕，破坚，下血闭，生子大，良。一名地鳖。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143435-hb7nhao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-hb7nhao","updated":"20240612143435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：（庶虫）虫，一名土鳖（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143435-bnj9owu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-bnj9owu","updated":"20240612143435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名土鳖，生河东及沙中，人家墙壁下，土中湿处，十月暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143435-3xe76kc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143435-3xe76kc","updated":"20240612143435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蟅虫属蠜，目蠜也。《广雅》云：负蠜，蟅也。《尔雅》云：草虫，负蠜。郭璞云：常羊也。《毛诗》云：喓喓草虫。《传》云：草虫，常羊也。陆玑云：小大长短如蝗也，奇音，青色，好在茅草中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143917-ukmxlab","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143917-ukmxlab"}},{"ID":"20240612143919-8kh18dl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143919-8kh18dl","updated":"20240612143924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"土鳖虫《雷公炮制药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143919-nia9kw6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143919-nia9kw6","updated":"20240612143919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，性寒有毒，入心肝脾三经。主留血壅瘀，心腹寒热洗洗，祛坚积症瘕、下乳通经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143919-ygq6gq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143919-ygq6gq4","updated":"20240612143919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名？虫，畏屋游，皂角、菖蒲。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143919-64y5kvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143919-64y5kvu","updated":"20240612143919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶土鳖专主血症，心主血，肝藏血，脾裹血，故三入之。今跌打损伤者，往往主此，或不效则加而用之。殊不知有瘀血作疼者，诚为要药；倘无瘀血，而其伤在筋骨脏腑之间，法当和补。愚者不察，久服弗已，其流祸可胜数耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143814-wrogi0a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143814-wrogi0a"}},{"ID":"20240612143816-fytfcue","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-fytfcue","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【本草汇言】"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-4x1s26n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-4x1s26n","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《神农本草经》：蟅虫，味咸，寒。主心腹寒热，洗洗，血积症瘕，破坚，下血闭，生子大，良。一名地鳖。生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-cbxaub2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-cbxaub2","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：（庶虫）虫，一名土鳖（《御览》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-f6vvcle","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-f6vvcle","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名土鳖，生河东及沙中，人家墙壁下，土中湿处，十月暴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-1rdnh8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-1rdnh8i","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：蟅虫属蠜，目蠜也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-myvi2c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-myvi2c7","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《广雅》云：负蠜，蟅也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-jgmnbmq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-jgmnbmq","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《尔雅》云：草虫，负蠜。郭璞云：常羊也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-cdopf3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-cdopf3y","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《毛诗》云：喓喓草虫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-pbtpjme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-pbtpjme","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《传》云：草虫，常羊也。陆玑云：小大长短如蝗也，奇音，青色，好在茅草中。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-9nvzmly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-9nvzmly","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性论》：使，畏屋游，味苦，咸。治月水不通，破留血积聚。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-jw2fgwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-jw2fgwk","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草图经》：仲景治杂病方及久瘕积结，有大黄虫丸，又有大鳖甲丸及妇人药并用之，以其有破坚下血之功也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-ea901du","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-ea901du","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：行产后血，折伤瘀血，治重舌木舌口疮，小儿腹痛夜啼。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-bbbl1nn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-bbbl1nn","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草经疏》：虫生于下湿土壤之中，故其味咸，气寒。得幽暗之气，故其性有小毒。以刀断之，中有白汁 如浆，凑接即连，复能行走，故今人以之治跌扑损伤，续筋骨有奇效。乃足厥阴经药也。夫血者，身中之真阴也。灌溉百骸，周流经络者也。血若凝滞则经络不通，阴阳之用互乖，而寒热洗洗生焉。咸寒能入血软坚，故主心腹血积，癥瘕血闭诸证，血和而荣卫通畅，寒热自除，经脉调匀，月事时至，而令妇人生子也。又治疟母为必用之药。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-hx5hnzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-hx5hnzk","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简误：无瘀血停留者，不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-1bw7sbl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-1bw7sbl","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮制药性解》：土鳖虫，味咸，性寒，有毒，入心、肝、脾三经。主留血壅瘀、心腹寒热洗洗，祛坚积癥瘕，下乳通经。一名䘌虫。畏屋游、皂角、菖蒲。\n按：土鳖专主血症，心主血，肝藏血，脾裹血，故三入之。今跌打损伤者，往往主此，或不效则加而用之。殊不知有瘀血作疼者，诚为要药；倘无瘀血，而其伤在筋骨脏腑之间，法当和补。愚者不察，久服弗已，其流祸可胜数耶！"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-oruisft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-oruisft","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草乘雅半偈》：一名过街，逢申过街，立建以冲日破也。是主寒热 洗洗，致血积症瘕者。冲其街舍，而破除之，故能破坚，下血闭。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-eesfg9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-eesfg9h","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草崇原》：《金匮》方中治久病结积，有大黄虫丸。又治疟痞，有鳖甲煎丸。及妇人下瘀血汤方并用之。今外科、接骨科亦用之。乃攻坚破积，行血散疟之剂。学者以意会之可也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-ycoi4im","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-ycoi4im","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《得配本草》：即地鳖虫\n畏皂荚、菖蒲、屋游。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-66u0ohe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-66u0ohe","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咸，寒，有毒。破宿血积聚，敷重舌木舌。配乳香、没药、自然铜、龙骨等分，加麝香少许，每服三分，酒下，治折伤接骨。\n去足，或炒，或酒醉死用。如无瘀血不宜用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-p6dabkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-p6dabkr","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草求真》：［批］凉血破积，软坚接骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-qsoxpo7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-qsoxpo7","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"虫专入肝。即属地鳖，又名土鳖者是也。味咸性寒。其物生于土中，伏而不出，善攻隙穴。以刀断之，中有汁如浆，斗接即连，复能行走，故书载跌仆损伤，续筋接骨，义由此耳。真奇物也。且人阴血贯于周身，虽赖阳和，亦忌燥烈。若热气内郁，则阴阳阻隔而经络不通，因而寒热顿生，得此咸寒入血软坚，则凡血聚积块 癥瘕，靡不因是而除。而血脉调和，营卫畅达，月事时至，又安有血枯血闭，而不见其生育者乎。故又能治诸 般血症而使挟孕而有子也。是以古人用此以治跌扑损伤，则多合自然铜、龙骨、血竭、乳香、没药、五珠钱、"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-nti5mgv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-nti5mgv","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"黄荆子、麻皮灰、狗头骨以治。下腹痛，血痛血闭，则合桃仁、大黄以治。颂曰：张仲景治杂病方，及久病积结，有大黄虫丸，又有大鳖甲丸及妇人药并用之，以其有破坚下血之功。各随病症所因而用之耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-ufrzdot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-ufrzdot","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经疏证》：夫血者灌溉百骸，周流经络者也。血若凝滞，则经络不通，阴阳之用互乖，寒热洗洗生焉， 咸寒能入血软坚，故主心腹血积癥瘕血闭诸证，血和则营卫通畅，寒热自除，经脉调匀，月事时至，遂令妇人有子也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-6ub8u3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-6ub8u3n","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仲景治畜血用水蛭虻虫，治干血则复加虫蛴螬，为其能化血导血，助水蛭虻虫以成功，而不济其悍，以致决裂，为干血因于虚劳故也。试观鳖甲煎丸，止用虫蜣螂，而置虻虫水蛭，则可知破血之功，不在虫蛴螬矣。产后瘀血腹痛，仍用抵当内之大黄桃仁，却以虫代虻虫水蛭，其义亦可思矣。愚谓参土瓜根散虫之用，益可知也。夫经一月现见，而曰不利，乃桂枝所主，所谓通中不通者也。满痛不在胁下腹中，而在少腹，乃芍药所主，所谓阴结阳不布也。二病者由于带下，则因带而经络泣涩，用土瓜根是滑泽其途径，用虫是连络其断续也。且通而谓之不利，必其经脉仍通，泣涩则在络，土瓜根本治络中泣涩之物，虫则固经中断续之物矣。陆农师谓虫于申日过街，故名曰过街虫。夫虫过则从横穿可知，直行曰经，横行曰络，络固经之横者也。虫之主络中泣涩断续，其亦取象于此欤。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-8076omk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-8076omk","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草分经》：咸，寒。有毒。搜剔血积，接折伤。治木舌，通乳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-jmqdyq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-jmqdyq4","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"来源产地】"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-qbn4ra8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-qbn4ra8","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草经集注》陶弘景\n生河东川泽及沙中，人家墙壁下土中湿处。十月取曝干。\n形扁扁如鳖，故名土鳖，而有甲，不能飞，小有臭气，今人家亦有之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-pbnc4sy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-pbnc4sy","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》\n为鳖蠊科昆虫地鳖或冀地鳖的雌虫干燥体。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-9gv21p6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-9gv21p6","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-bvr76ee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-bvr76ee","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《长沙药解》黄元御\n炒枯存性，研细用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-x2k1uzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-x2k1uzh","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"【现代药理研究】"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-fl6sp15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-fl6sp15","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.土鳖虫提取物具有抗血栓与抗凝血作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-fv6zuri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-fv6zuri","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.土鳖虫有一定的调节血脂作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-z9zxuqu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-z9zxuqu","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.土鳖虫雌成虫的己烷可溶部分及 CCl4 可溶部分可抑制 D-半乳糖胺所致的肝损害。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-x066mol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-x066mol","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.土鳖虫总生物碱水提物有抗缺氧作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143816-lzqlij6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143816-lzqlij6","updated":"20240612143816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.土鳖虫还有抗突变与抗肿瘤的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143345-9xkk8rp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143345-9xkk8rp"}},{"ID":"20240612143346-a4vvv7h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-a4vvv7h","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蟅虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-4igbrqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-4igbrqe","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-7sj4epq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-7sj4epq","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Zhè Chónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-9ylxlqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-9ylxlqi","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-qtvbgr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-qtvbgr5","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 地鳖（《本经》），土鳖（《别录》），过街（《埤雅》），簸箕虫（《本草衍义》），蚵蚾虫（《袖珍方》），地婢虫（《鲍氏小儿方》），山蟑螂（《本草求原》），地乌龟（《分类草药性》），土元（《中药形性经验鉴别法》），臭虫母、盖子虫（《河北药材》），土虫（《吉林中草药》），节节虫、蚂蚁虎（《江苏药材志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-trkryze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-trkryze","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-7soumqj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-7soumqj","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-50b7op8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-50b7op8","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-rvymgi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-rvymgi9","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为鳖蠊科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"地鳖"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或姬蠊科昆虫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"赤边水蟅"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"雄性全虫"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。5～8月间捕捉。用炒香麦麸撒于地上以诱捕之，或晚上用灯光诱捕。捕得后，用沸水烫死，晒干或烤干；亦可用清水洗净后，再用盐水煮过，晒干或烤干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-9klruuz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-9klruuz","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-utm7bfn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-utm7bfn","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①地鳖"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-frhvhvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-frhvhvl","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雌雄异形，雄虫有翅，雌虫无翅。雌虫长约3厘米，体上下扁平，黑色而带光泽。头小，向腹面弯曲。口器咀嚼式，大颚坚硬。复眼发达，肾脏形；单眼2个。触角丝状，长而多节。前胸扩大如盾状，前狭后阔，盖于头上。雄虫前胸呈波状纹，有缺刻，具翅2对，前翅革质，后翅膜质，不用时折成扇状。足3对，发育相等，具细毛，生刺颇多，基部扩大，盖及胸膛面及腹基部分，跗节5；具2爪。腹部第1腹节极短，其腹板不发达，第8、9两腹节之背板缩短，昆须1对。雄虫第9腹板有腹刺1对；雌虫第8、9两腹板缩藏于第7腹板的里面。生殖器不突出。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-m0sh8ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-m0sh8ck","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活于地下或沙土间，多见于粮仓底下或油坊阴湿处。昼伏夜出，觅食腐殖质及淀粉等物。全国大部地区均有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-gmdkpli","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-gmdkpli","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②赤边水蟅，又名：药用光蠊。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-4jgbd7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-4jgbd7j","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雌雄虫形态相似。雌虫长2.7～3.3厘米；雄虫长2.2～2.4厘米。体黑褐色。头部位于前胸下。眼不发达，眼间区宽。前胸背板呈三角形，两侧后角近于垂直。前侧缘有淡黄色镶边。前后翅均退化为翅基，末端尖削。足粗短，腿节下缘有巨刺。腹节腹板雌虫仅见7节，雄虫可见8节。尾须粗短。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-jcy1kda","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-jcy1kda","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生活于油坊、酱坊、灶脚下及墙角阴湿松土中。分布华南及福建、台湾等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-ik7can5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-ik7can5","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-776mm49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-776mm49","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①土鳖虫"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-i03kqrh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-i03kqrh","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为昆虫地鳖的干燥雌虫。呈卵圆形而扁平，长2～3厘米，宽1～2厘米。头部一端较窄；尾部较宽；背面紫黑色，呈甲壳状，为9个横节覆瓦状排列而成。腹面深棕色，有光泽，可见小形的头部，棕黑色；触角1对，多已脱落。脚部足3对，弯曲，腹部隆起，有弯曲的节，尾节较宽而略尖。质松脆，易破碎，腹内有灰黑色物质，气腥臭，味微咸。以完整、油润光泽，无泥者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-d6dkcho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-d6dkcho","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产江苏、浙江、河南、湖北等地。此外，安徽、山东、河北、山西、陕西、内蒙古等地亦产。以江苏、浙江所产者个小，体轻、腹中无泥，品质最优，称为\"苏土元\"；其他地区所产个大体重，腹中含泥，品质较次，称\"大土元\"或\"汉土元\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-0rmhv7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-0rmhv7t","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②金边土鳖"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-f7rh3gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-f7rh3gu","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又名：金边地鳖虫。为昆虫赤边水蟅的干燥雌虫。呈长卵形而扁，长3～3.5厘米，宽1.5～2厘米。背面黑棕色，有光泽，呈甲壳状，有10个横节，第1节较宽，边缘有黄色狭边，以下9节边缘为红棕色，每节均有锯齿，第2、3节的两侧，各有1对特异的翅状物。腹面红棕色，有光泽。余与上种相同。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-jjzagwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-jjzagwf","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产福建，广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-4jrmyb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-4jrmyb1","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此外，鳖蠊科昆虫冀地鳖的干燥雌虫，亦入药用。产北京。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-ku73bm6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-ku73bm6","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-nuxkigd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-nuxkigd","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 在试管内，用美蓝法曾测得地鳖虫浸膏（水煎后加醇沉淀）有抑制白血病患者的白细胞的作用，但用瓦伯氏呼吸器法，则为阴性结果。土鳖虫与全蝎、蜈蚣混合研末制成的\"结核散\"，在试臂内对人型结核杆菌无抑菌作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-21v72vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-21v72vg","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-a2namgi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-a2namgi","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 拣净杂质，以沸水洗净，文火焙干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-49j71jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-49j71jy","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草通玄》：\"去足，炒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-fxo5iwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-fxo5iwp","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《得配本草》：\"去足，或炒、或酒醉死用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-o5wh039","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-o5wh039","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-0frlbnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-0frlbnt","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入心、肝、脾三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-31prkw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-31prkw8","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-f30qa58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-f30qa58","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 咸，寒，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-0hvjaqh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-0hvjaqh","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味咸，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-cjl0s9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-cjl0s9p","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"消毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-oyp1aku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-oyp1aku","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"味苦咸。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-8fkjlnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-8fkjlnc","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-w98vclz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-w98vclz","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-3tkay1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-3tkay1c","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"畏皂荚、菖蒲。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-e9wqfcp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-e9wqfcp","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"畏屋游。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-eexb8cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-eexb8cg","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经疏》：\"无瘀血停留者不宜用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-pqsmn4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-pqsmn4c","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-rz8o9ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-rz8o9ra","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 逐瘀，破积，通络，理伤。治症瘕积聚，血滞经闭，产后瘀血腹痛，跌打损伤，木舌，重舌。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-4s6nnjz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-4s6nnjz","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主心腹寒热洗洗，血积症瘕，破坚，下血闭。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-divudhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-divudhg","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药性论》：\"治月水不通，破留血积聚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-7t740mc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-7t740mc","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草衍义》：\"乳脉不行，研一枚，水半合，滤清服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-kkz51xz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-kkz51xz","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《纲目》：\"行产后血积，折伤瘀血，治重舌，术舌，口疮，小儿腹痛夜啼。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-3mr87qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-3mr87qz","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草通玄》：\"破一切血积，跌打重伤，接骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-l6ym0lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-l6ym0lt","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草再新》：\"消水肿，败毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-wdyxrhb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-wdyxrhb","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《分类草药性》：\"治跌打损伤，风湿筋骨痛，消肿，吹喉症。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-iyinl9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-iyinl9l","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-zck0wq1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-zck0wq1","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，1～2钱；或入丸、散。外用：煎水含漱或捣敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-gwraym5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-gwraym5","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-mh7pgy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-mh7pgy0","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治五劳虚极羸瘦，腹满，不能饮食，食伤，忧伤，饮伤，房室伤，饥伤，劳伤，经络荣卫气伤，内有干血，肌肤甲错，两目黯黑。缓中补虚：大黄十分（蒸），黄芩二两，甘草三两，桃仁一升，杏仁一升，芍药四两，干地黄十两，干漆一两，虻虫一升，水蛭百枚，蛴螬一升，蟅虫半升。上十二味，末之，炼蜜和丸，小豆大。酒饮服五丸，日三服。（《金匮要略》大黄蟅虫丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-8lev518","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-8lev518","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治产妇腹痛，腹中有干血着脐下，亦主经水不利：大黄三两，桃仁二十枚，蟅虫二十枚（熬，去足）。上三味，末之，炼蜜和为四丸。以酒一升，煎一丸，取八合，顿服之，新血下如豚肝。（《金匮要略》下瘀血汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-isdt6i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-isdt6i2","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治折伤，接骨：㈠土鳖焙存性，为末，每服二、三钱。（《医方摘要》）㈡蚵蚾六钱（隔纸，砂锅内焙干），自然铜二两（火煅醋淬七次）。为末。每服二钱，温酒调下，病在上，食后服；病在下，食前服。（《袖珍方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-0uvqs59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-0uvqs59","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治疯狗咬伤：蟅虫七个（去足，炒），生大黄三钱，桃仁七粒（去皮，尖）。白蜜三钱，黄酒一碗，煎至七分服。（《吉林中草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-z3n3aqi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-z3n3aqi","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治重舌满口，不得语：蟅虫七枚（微炒），盐一两半。以水一大盏，同煎五、七沸。含令吐，勿咽，日三，五上。（《圣惠方》煎含蟅虫汤）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-ne4c78k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-ne4c78k","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治重舌塞痛：地鳖虫和生薄荷研汁，帛包捻舌下肿处。（《鲍氏小儿方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-lreud0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-lreud0g","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治小儿腹痛夜啼：蟅虫半分（微炒），赤芍药一分，芎藭一分。捣罗为末。每眼，以温酒调下半钱。量儿大小，加减服之。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-il0s8je","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-il0s8je","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治瘰疬：鲜地鳖虫、陈瓦花（在屋上隔年者佳，瓦上煅存性）。同捣烂。用膏药贴上，未溃即消，已溃即敛。（《中医杂志》（21）：6，1926）"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-awaown3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-awaown3","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-kjbdt3j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-kjbdt3j","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本草经疏》：\"蟅虫，治跌扑损伤，续筋骨有奇效。乃足厥阴经药也。夫血者，身中之真阴也，灌溉百骸，周流经络者也。血若凝滞，则经络不通，阴阳之用互乖，而寒热洗洗生焉。咸寒能入血软坚，故主心腹血积，症瘕血闭诸证。血和而营卫通畅，寒热自除，经脉调匀，月事时至而令妇人生子也，又治疟母为必用之药。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-81h0me9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-81h0me9","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《长沙药解》：\"蟅虫善化瘀血，最补损伤，《金匮》鳖甲煎丸用之治病疟日久，结为症瘕；大黄蟅虫丸用之治虚劳腹满，内有干血；下瘀血汤用之治产后腹痛，内有瘀血；土瓜根散用之治经水不利，少腹满痛。以其消癥而破瘀也。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-zwla2lt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-zwla2lt","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草求真》：\"蟅虫，古人用此以治跌打损伤，则多合自然铜、龙骨、血竭、乳香、没药、五铢钱、黄荆子、麻皮灰、狗头骨。以治下腹痛、血痛、血闭，则合桃仁、大黄。各随病症所因而用之耳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-thvz0ny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-thvz0ny","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612143346-a45zr0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143346-a45zr0k","updated":"20240612143346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612143518-wn1c3pn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612143518-wn1c3pn"}},{"ID":"20240612143520-41448c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612143520-41448c7"}}]}